# anthropic_organization_members (Data Source)

Lists all members (Users) of the organization via the Admin API. All pages are fetched automatically.

Results can optionally be filtered by `email`.

> **API**: `GET /v1/organizations/users` (Admin API).
> **Auth**: Admin API key (`admin_api_key` / `ANTHROPIC_ADMIN_API_KEY`).
> **Beta header**: None.
> **Cost**: Free.

